cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASLA in your research, please cite it."
title: "ASLA: Algorithm-Selection Leaderboard Audit"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SAID Laboratory"
abstract: >-
  ASLA audits whether small-compute scaling-law projections select the same
  training intervention that measured target-budget runs would select. It
  provides decision-level metrics with bootstrap confidence intervals,
  FDR-controlled crossover detection, misspecification-aware ensemble
  projections with an extrapolation reliability score, cost-aware sequential
  selection (racing), conformal projection intervals, and a parameterized
  benchmark (ASLA-Bench) with known ground truth.
repository-code: "https://github.com/esaran1/algorithm-selection-audit"
